        },
        "subject": "LU-21089 tests: destroy the middle of three snapshots",
        "message": "LU-21089 tests: destroy the middle of three snapshots\n\nsanity-lsnapshot destroys only a single snapshot. Add test_7: take\nthree snapshots with different file contents, destroy the middle\none, and check that the other two still mount and show their own\ndata. On ldiskfs over LVM thin LVs this checks that removing one\nthin LV leaves the blocks of the other snapshots alone.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial fstype=zfs testlist=sanity-lsnapshot\nSigned-off-by: Hiroshi Nishida <hnishida@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: I4e856abd07bba6fbfd75efe7ea2e36530d84ed83\n"
      },
